# gh-407: Parity with agents#898/#899: stale .claude-session-id retry; ADO search result keeps the work item id

## Description

Shared agents fixes (IstiN/dmtools-agents#900, #901). (1) #898: scripts/providers/claude.sh retries once without --resume when the stored session cannot be resumed, and .claude-session-id is excluded from auto-save commits. (2) #899: adoSearchIssues asks for Title/State/Tags/Type and maps Jira-style columns; toIssueView/normalizeTicket recognise an ADO item by any System.* field. Dart needs: bump the agents submodule to the commit containing both, then check on the Dart runtime (a) that ado_search_by_wiql with fields [System.Title,System.State,System.Tags,System.WorkItemType] returns them and (b) the SM dry run on ADO dispatches with a numeric key (no 'Invalid ticket key: undefined').
----
{
  "key": "gh-407",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "Parity with agents#898/#899: stale .claude-session-id retry; ADO search result keeps the work item id",
    "description": "Shared agents fixes (IstiN/dmtools-agents#900, #901). (1) #898: scripts/providers/claude.sh retries once without --resume when the stored session cannot be resumed, and .claude-session-id is excluded from auto-save commits. (2) #899: adoSearchIssues asks for Title/State/Tags/Type and maps Jira-style columns; toIssueView/normalizeTicket recognise an ADO item by any System.* field. Dart needs: bump the agents submodule to the commit containing both, then check on the Dart runtime (a) that ado_search_by_wiql with fields [System.Title,System.State,System.Tags,System.WorkItemType] returns them and (b) the SM dry run on ADO dispatches with a numeric key (no 'Invalid ticket key: undefined')."
  }
}----
main

